{
  "$comment": "VAPP-92: the RECIPE contract. A theme styles a component PART under a `when` selector (the node's recipe props + the interaction `state`); this file fixes what a theme may name. `states` = the interaction states a painter reports (`default` is the absence of all; round 1 adds `invalid` = a field whose checks failed, `dragover` = a drop zone a drag hovers); `keys` = the whitelist a recipe style may set: a SUBSET of style.json's visual keys plus the padding/gap/size keys a part's box needs and `native` (true = the painter may use the platform's own control for this part, geometry still from the tokens); round 1 lets a recipe set `transition`/`transitionEasing` (so a theme's motion tokens finally animate hover/press/open), `transform` (a chevron that rotates when `open`), `borderStyle`, the four per-side border widths (an app bar's bottom rule, a tab bar's top rule), `textDecoration`, `letterSpacing`, `fontStyle`, `textTransform`. A part-level discriminator the painter supplies per drawn piece: CodeBlock/token `kind` (the codeToken enum), Table/headerCell+cell `align` and Table/row `striped` (true on ODD rows of a striped table), Stepper's step `status` (a macro `$recipe`). `native` lists every native component's PARTS (the painter paints each part with its resolved recipe) and the PROPS a `when` may key on (the component's enum/boolean props; the catalog default fills an unset one, so a theme always sees a concrete value; a part-level discriminator the PAINTER supplies is listed too, see below). Macro parts come from macros.json (every template `part`) and their `when` props from the macro's `recipeProps` (+ a part's `$recipe` keys); src/recipes.ts derives them. Both lists are append-only.",
  "states": ["hover", "pressed", "focus", "disabled", "checked", "open", "selected", "invalid", "dragover"],
  "keys": [
    "backgroundColor", "color", "borderColor", "borderWidth", "borderTopWidth", "borderRightWidth", "borderBottomWidth", "borderLeftWidth", "borderRadius", "borderStyle",
    "padding", "paddingHorizontal", "paddingVertical", "gap",
    "width", "height", "minWidth", "minHeight",
    "fontSize", "fontWeight", "lineHeight", "fontFamily", "letterSpacing", "textDecoration", "textTransform", "fontStyle",
    "boxShadow", "opacity", "transition", "transitionEasing", "transform", "native"
  ],
  "native": {
